  "macroRenderedOutput": {},
  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p>There are a few tips that doctors can use to increase their productivity while using the app.</p><h4>iPAD</h4><ul><li>Set the screen lock limit to maximum. E.g. 15 mins to avoid unlocking for every patient. Don't make it &quot;Never&quot; for security and power saving.</li><li>Set Bahmni as home page.</li><li>Keep minimum tabs open for better device/browser/internet speed.</li><li>Train on how to close unnecessary opened apps. This might come handy while fixing a slow iPAD.</li><li>Personalise the usage by setting keyboard shortcut for frequently used terms in Bahmni. Each doctor can identify and set his shortcuts.</li><li>Suggest trying restarting the iPAD when nothing seems to be working.&nbsp;</li></ul><h4>Chrome book</h4>",
      "representation": "storage",
      "embeddedContent": [],
      "_expandable": {
        "content": "/rest/api/content/16908292"
      }
    },
    "view": {
      "value": "<p>There are a few tips that doctors can use to increase their productivity while using the app.</p><h4 id=\"TipstoincreaseproductivitywhileusingBahmni-iPAD\">iPAD</h4><ul><li>Set the screen lock limit to maximum. E.g. 15 mins to avoid unlocking for every patient. Don't make it &quot;Never&quot; for security and power saving.</li><li>Set Bahmni as home page.</li><li>Keep minimum tabs open for better device/browser/internet speed.</li><li>Train on how to close unnecessary opened apps. This might come handy while fixing a slow iPAD.</li><li>Personalise the usage by setting keyboard shortcut for frequently used terms in Bahmni. Each doctor can identify and set his shortcuts.</li><li>Suggest trying restarting the iPAD when nothing seems to be working. </li></ul><h4 id=\"TipstoincreaseproductivitywhileusingBahmni-Chromebook\">Chrome book</h4>",
      "representation": "view",
